<title>USA: Dravo says CFO resigns, sets buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Dravo says CFO resigns, sets buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dravo Corp on Friday said that Ernest Ladd, executive vice president and chief financial officer of the company, will leave the company at the end of this month.</p>
<p>It said a search for a replacement is underway.</p>
<p>Dravo also said it has started the process of selecting a consultant to carry out a review of current operations.</p>
<p>The company also said it will purchase up to one million shares of its common stock from time to time in open market or negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
